## Current stop — R6 source-review checkpoint

The local implementation items checked above have source/static-review receipts only. The 2026-10-18 continuation extends the prior checkpoint with concrete online broker scope/issuance/capacity/revocation wiring and segmented project inputs; its current receipt is in continuation-2026-10-18, while root-level hashes/delta retain the prior freeze. Native full termination attestation remains unimplemented and native placement is explicitly ineligible. Trusted host configuration, actual tree sealing, capacity, disk headroom, inherited integration findings and all runtime acceptance remain blockers. R7 is entirely unexecuted.

No tests, builds, typechecks, runtime imports/probes, trial restores, services, installations, cloud provider operations, provisioning, spending, secret changes, commits, pushes, merges, deployments or cleanup were performed. Baseline/source/disk observations, metadata inventories, source/document edits and local receipt preparation are the actual evidence.

